---
import BlogPosts from '@components/BlogPosts.astro';
import Section from '@components/Section.astro';
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Daniel Moffat | Developer" description="Backend developer working remotely for Give as you Live building online fundraising products for charity.">
    <Section title="About" id="about">
        <p>Software developer currently working remotely for <a href="https://www.giveasyoulive.com/about-us">Give as you Live</a>, a company that builds online fundraising products for charities.</p> 
        <p>Day-to-day I mostly write backend code (Java and Spring) and work on our <a href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/give-as-you-live-donation/fceblikkhnkbdimejiaapjnijnfegnii?hl=en-GB">cross-platform browser extension</a>, <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.giveasyoulive.taptopay&hl=en_GB">contactless donation app</a> and <a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/give-as-you-live/id739773339">iOS shopping app</a>.</p>
        <p>I'm able to learn new programming languages, frameworks and libraries on the job and am comfortable working on any aspect of a website/app, whether that be frontend development, deployment or diagnosing performance problems.</p>
        <p>I believe in writing code which solves real problems, whether that be making a process quicker for an end-user, or saving a member of staff from manual, repetitive jobs.</p>
        <p>Outside of work I enjoy include hiking (with my dog, Norman), playing guitar and working out.</p>
    </Section>

    <Section title="Writing" id="writing">
        <p>I occasionally write about things that I build and learn, or other random thoughts, here are my latest posts:</p>
        <BlogPosts 
            excludeDrafts={false} 
            maxPosts={6} 
        />
    </Section>

    <Section title="Projects" id="projects">
        <p>Most of my recent work has been for the company I work for, <a href="https://www.giveasyoulive.com">Give as you Live</a>:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.giveasyoulive.taptopay&hl=en_GB">Tap to Donate</a> - a contactless donation app on Android and iOS with over £100k in donations.</li>
            <li><a href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/give-as-you-live-donation/fceblikkhnkbdimejiaapjnijnfegnii?hl=en-GB">Donation Reminder</a> - a browser extension for affiliate-based charity donations, with an <a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/give-as-you-live/id739773339">iOS app</a> for mobile.</li>
            <li><a href="https://donate.giveasyoulive.com">Give as you Live Donate</a> - a fundraising and donation platform for charities that's processed millions of pounds in donations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>I also post my personal projects on <a href="https://github.com/danmofo">GitHub</a>.</p>
    </Section>

    <Section title="Contact" id="contact">
        <p>If you'd like to contact me, the best place is via email <b>danmofo+website[at]gmail.com</b>.</p>
    </Section>
</BaseLayout>